Creating a professional video subtitle adding tool involves combining a web interface with video processing libraries. Below is a **complete working prototype** using **HTML, CSS, JavaScript (with Web Audio API for timeline markers)** and **FFmpeg via a worker** (or a local node module via `ffmpeg-static`) to embed subtitles into the final video. This tool allows:

- Uploading a video.
- Adding multiple text captions with start/end times (via timeline markers).
- Customizing font, color, position, and background opacity.
- Exporting the final video with embedded subtitles (WebVTT format).

---

## ✅ Prerequisites

Install `ffmpeg-static` globally (or use a local copy via `ffmpeg-static` NPM package):

```bash
npm install ffmpeg-static
```

---

## 📁 Project Structure

```
index.html
style.css
script.js
```

---

## 📄 index.html

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Subtitle Editor</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="brand">
      <span class="logo">🎬</span>
      <h1>Subtitle Editor</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="status" id="status">Ready</div>
  </header>

  <section class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <h2>Upload Video</h2>
      <p>Drop or click to upload a video file</p>
    </div>
    <div class="dropzone" id="dropzone">
      <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept="video/*" hidden />
      <div class="dz-content">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><polyline points="17 8 12 3 7 8"/><line x1="12" y1="3" x2="12" y2="15"/></svg>
        <p>Click to upload or drag & drop</p>
        <span class="hint">MP4, WebM, MOV up to 100MB</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="file-info" id="fileInfo" hidden>
      <div class="file-row">
        <span class="label">Name</span>
        <span class="value" id="fileName"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="file-row">
        <span class="label">Duration</span>
        <span class="value" id="fileDuration"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="file-row">
        <span class="label">Resolution</span>
        <span class="value" id="fileRes"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <h2>Timeline</h2>
      <p>Click and drag to add captions</p>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline" id="timeline">
      <div class="tl-track" id="tlTrack"></div>
      <div class="tl-playhead" id="tlPlayhead"></div>
      <div class="tl-controls">
        <button id="playBtn" class="icon-btn" title="Play">▶</button>
        <input type="range" id="tlSeek" min="0" max="100" value="0" />
        <span id="tlTime">0:00</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <div class="panel-title">
      <h2>Subtitles</h2>
      <p>Add captions with custom styling</p>
    </div>
    <div class="subtitle-list" id="subtitleList"></div>
    <div class="subtitle-toolbar">
      <div class="toolbar-group">
        <label for="fontFamily">Font</label>
        <select id="fontFamily">
          <option value="Arial, sans-serif">Arial</option>
          <option value="Georgia, serif">Georgia</option>
          <option value="Courier New, monospace">Courier</option>
          <option value="Helvetica, sans-serif">Helvetica</option>
        </select>
      </div>
