## ✅ How to Run

### 1. Start the server

```bash
cd server
npm install
npm start
```

### 2. Start the client

```bash
cd client
npm install
npm start
```

### 3. Use the app

- Upload video/audio files (drag or click).
- Drag files from the Upload Panel into the Timeline.
- Drag clips on the Timeline to reorder them.
- Click "Export" to generate the final video using FFmpeg.
- The generated video will appear in the Preview pane.

