- Navigate bookmarks with keyboard arrows or a list.
- Export bookmarks as a JSON file.
- Import bookmarks from a JSON file.
- Drag the playhead along the timeline.
- Drag bookmarks to reorder them.
- Delete bookmarks.
- Thumbnails are uploaded via file input or dragged & dropped.
- Responsive UI.

